  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Revison Sida at Work</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xD6;versyn S&#xE5; arbetar Sida</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas metodanvisning &quot;S&#xE5; arbetar Sida&quot; har sedan den utkom 1997 testats i det praktiska arbetet. Med tanke p&#xE5; den utveckling som skett under de fyra senaste &#xE5;ren finns ett behov av revidering.En &#xF6;versyn av &quot;S&#xE5; arbetar Sida&quot; kommer d&#xE4;rf&#xF6;r att ske under h&#xF6;sten 2001 och en uppdaterad version distribueras i april 2002.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The first edition of &quot;Sida at work&quot; was published in 1997. Considering developments during the past four years and experiences of using &quot;Sida at work&quot; in practise a review of the text will be undertaken during the second half of 2001. An updated version is expected to be distributed in April 2002.</narrative>
  </description>
